Registers the two Pyxis bridge JSWindowActor files with the toolkit actors
packaging list so they are actually shipped in the build.

This is small but load-bearing, and its absence fails SILENTLY: without these
two entries the actor .sys.mjs files compile and are referenced by
ActorManagerParent's PyxisBridge registration, but never get copied into
dist/bin/actors/, so the bridge simply never instantiates at runtime and
`window.geckoOS` is undefined with no error anywhere. Same failure shape as
the MatchPattern/StaticAtoms bug documented in those two notes.

Companion to the new (verbatim, non-diff) files
gecko/patches/pyxis/toolkit/actors/PyxisBridge{Child,Parent}.sys.mjs and to
toolkit/modules/ActorManagerParent.sys.mjs.PYXIS_DIFF.

════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
The unified diff below is generated from the checkout and is applied with
  git apply gecko/patches/pyxis/<path>.PYXIS_DIFF
(or `patch -p1 <`). Everything above this line is rationale, not content;
git apply ignores it. Regenerate with scripts/regen-gecko-patches.sh.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

diff --git a/toolkit/actors/moz.build b/toolkit/actors/moz.build
index 9b5d83e11a23..3e93b7ec6b88 100644
--- a/toolkit/actors/moz.build
+++ b/toolkit/actors/moz.build
@@ -64,6 +64,8 @@ FINAL_TARGET_FILES.actors += [
     "PrintingParent.sys.mjs",
     "PrintingSelectionChild.sys.mjs",
     "PurgeSessionHistoryChild.sys.mjs",
+    "PyxisBridgeChild.sys.mjs",
+    "PyxisBridgeParent.sys.mjs",
     "RemotePageChild.sys.mjs",
     "SelectChild.sys.mjs",
     "SelectParent.sys.mjs",
